<title>USA: Cox Communications to sell $150 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Cox Communications to sell $150 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cox Communications Inc is expected to sell $150 million in a 30-year debt offering one day this week, dealers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The issue is expected to be underwritten by lead manager Merrill Lynch &amp; Co, dealers said.</p>
<p>Cox Communications is among the largest U.S. cable television operators, serving more than 3.2 million customers.</p>
<p>(( -- Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675 ))</p>
